# Never send secrets, local state or host-built environments to the Docker daemon.
# A host .venv or node_modules copied into an image overwrites the Linux one with
# binaries for the wrong platform; .env and *.pem would leak into build layers.

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.data
.deploy
backups

**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
evals/reports
